{"id": "odezwa-12-00", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-00.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-00.txt", "text": "12", "sha256": "a517a96a8a8723cc59911fed7b8104c9ad52e31dcc7b266ef49193705c44758a", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 0, "source_bbox": [570, 18, 692, 74], "crop_method": "manual page-number box"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-01", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-01.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-01.txt", "text": "w usta. — A już inne trunki ani tego nawet nie mają.", "sha256": "6da398b012035e52dac088990cb3b23b27d2d33ada0c72e69d9c50829b7ab1fc", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 1, "source_bbox": [48, 130, 1220, 181], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-02", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-02.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-02.txt", "text": "Jeśli ludzie mówią, że napoje alkoholiczne dodają sił", "sha256": "8b7ad858567aaf4252b0a8bb38e66d2f4e5435659b23bdd3c48399f51020e6a1", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 2, "source_bbox": [48, 183, 1220, 236], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-03", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-03.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-03.txt", "text": "i wzmacniają, to sami siebie oszukują. Trucizna al-", "sha256": "70624c66debd745c1d46f2703933ff7e0bf332f5c00964694acda8fe1b1d377d", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 3, "source_bbox": [48, 237, 1220, 288], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-04", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-04.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-04.txt", "text": "kohol oszołomia rozum i podrażnia nerwy człowieka", "sha256": "778a44fc505d4fdccb61e723ecb2b4f6a1af0a1e1d1aee7046500f3ea401cd6b", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 4, "source_bbox": [48, 289, 1220, 338], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-05", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-05.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-05.txt", "text": "i nic więcej.", "sha256": "091e3606e47d578708a9cb6917e6ed9506251055b6e8a8829a56fa05b71c7f68", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 5, "source_bbox": [48, 337, 1220, 391], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-06", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-06.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-06.txt", "text": "Gdy się kto przyzwyczai do palenia cygar i pa-", "sha256": "75b458f50ba5d9d52bac87252eaeec344a9fd3697d67c3ea0dd5fea9dd711613", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 6, "source_bbox": [48, 396, 1220, 452], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-07", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-07.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-07.txt", "text": "pierosów, też mu się wydaje, że łyknąwszy porządnie", "sha256": "dc5f91cf7d8763e73258821deebf29c26c3590f80d08b8eb52fb1d2a931c7e4e", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 7, "source_bbox": [48, 451, 1220, 504], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-08", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-08.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-08.txt", "text": "parę razy dymu, jest mocniejszym i ochotniejszym do", "sha256": "bf67d3356cb58d93e9054a3b0c70a42adca1256178ef1eba73661f3117049576", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 8, "source_bbox": [48, 505, 1220, 556], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-09", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-09.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-09.txt", "text": "pracy. Ale każdy wie, że to tylko złudzenie, że dym", "sha256": "79da7ea26138adbdcff9af44525a9786be9a6c73ef9aff49c15d5b1c1bfe82b5", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 9, "source_bbox": [48, 555, 1220, 608], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-10", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-10.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-10.txt", "text": "podrażnia nerwy człowieka, iż przez jakiś czas nie", "sha256": "51c6a31c9f42178febf6528090bf438a4c78a63ce8f32a795a02cd24b4f01c09", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 10, "source_bbox": [48, 610, 1220, 662], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-11", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-11.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-11.txt", "text": "czuje tak bardzo swego zmęczenia; ale sił przez to", "sha256": "4ecc0bb2b2a3b4c78a5656855071f85c5f5e1dcf1588f03f58c85965e75b7af1", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 11, "source_bbox": [48, 663, 1220, 714], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-12", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-12.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-12.txt", "text": "łykanie dymu chyba tyle nie przybyło, co czarne za", "sha256": "ddb8b0161e1593d78e09c0783381ad1149e3647e87e855ca40ecbfc37cfd69f6", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 12, "source_bbox": [48, 715, 1220, 770], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-13", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-13.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-13.txt", "text": "paznogciem. —", "sha256": "8acc34ad181e34edb4c8a668aa2aa2066a9ab675c75001ea3196e14bd4c345be", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 13, "source_bbox": [48, 779, 1220, 812], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-14", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-14.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-14.txt", "text": "Podobnie ma się rzecz z trunkami alkoholicznymi.", "sha256": "fdaffc3fffe7de6ce315b1216eb144edf481ec14414f3d25e5787d6117e8390c", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 14, "source_bbox": [48, 823, 1220, 870], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-15", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-15.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-15.txt", "text": "Nie dają one mocy człowiekowi, tylko go poprostu", "sha256": "5f2d62c6681bd103af7cd25553ba0d537c9293fcfccb8fa09fbb1449c7ae9325", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 15, "source_bbox": [48, 876, 1220, 933], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-16", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-16.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-16.txt", "text": "oszukują. —", "sha256": "773fdd28ffc104006be7e9e14bbe333bd0b475d1de9beac85051e030685ff42a", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 16, "source_bbox": [48, 939, 1220, 972], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-17", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-17.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-17.txt", "text": "Jeżeli więc niektóre matki myślą, że dzieciom", "sha256": "75cef569e595871be58a90f6f881c9abdbe82e2e7152d5e7d52291250f292f8a", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 17, "source_bbox": [48, 983, 1220, 1036], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-18", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-18.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-18.txt", "text": "przy kieliszku sił przybędzie, to są w grubym błędzie.", "sha256": "3a0e751619a102eedbcca5e9c7c58d92abd9aca41e89fa6bda7d39a6c91ba618", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 18, "source_bbox": [48, 1037, 1220, 1092], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-19", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-19.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-19.txt", "text": "O gorzałce nie ma co mówić; chyba tylko taka matka,", "sha256": "4068e2cd28b53f22e167ebb48766e010d5761124d3883b45c25f1ce50f6c04b3", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 19, "source_bbox": [48, 1090, 1220, 1141], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-20", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-20.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-20.txt", "text": "która sama jest pijaczką, będzie pokrzepiała dziecko", "sha256": "f6da67495709920af6de34da487f9fb14b87a00eb2c8b6d7fcae831de03626ab", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 20, "source_bbox": [48, 1144, 1220, 1199], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-21", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-21.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-21.txt", "text": "gorzałką.", "sha256": "27d49406dfc2c71bdedededfefd60b2b24e8826e9b21a6ebffa9bc5280c1bb45", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 21, "source_bbox": [48, 1206, 1220, 1247], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-22", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-22.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-22.txt", "text": "Ale, mówicie, kochane matki, z winem tak źle nie", "sha256": "ce382fbbe75404a0824e2d30d9671fccfb5065abe95f97a74738ec9f23685e36", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 22, "source_bbox": [48, 1251, 1220, 1300], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-23", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-23.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-23.txt", "text": "będzie. Otóż z tego, cośmy dopiero widzieli, wynika, że", "sha256": "9695a9ccab84dcaaeecaef04a1529dd86b846bd644d54093a5948eb4860c4f1e", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 23, "source_bbox": [48, 1305, 1220, 1359], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-24", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-24.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-24.txt", "text": "wino wzmacniać dziecka nie może, bo nie ma w sobie", "sha256": "e7cb19d10401dc3fa7ce1d72f51bc737a79c9306a799a871cf7410eb3eae90c8", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 24, "source_bbox": [48, 1360, 1220, 1407], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-25", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-25.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-25.txt", "text": "wzmacniających, czyli pożywnych części. — Dużo za to", "sha256": "5cda523e54381016f56dab055485a48ee7b75a446503733146ba512ba070db25", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 25, "source_bbox": [48, 1412, 1220, 1466], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-26", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-26.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-26.txt", "text": "dziecku szkodzi, bo zawiera w sobie truciznę alkohol.", "sha256": "9a7155e48bc44bc56f4c513c3564555ca98ee4f36f15a248a06c36c140191a06", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 26, "source_bbox": [48, 1466, 1220, 1514], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-27", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-27.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-27.txt", "text": "To mówię nawet o najlepszem prawdziwem winie. Ale", "sha256": "9a3d3d4c3f97f69efd54bcf734c657ea7a8fef3a348a595a55c8dc3f3521c0db", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 27, "source_bbox": [48, 1519, 1220, 1573], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-28", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-28.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-28.txt", "text": "czy która z was myśli, że dostanie wino czyste, niefał-", "sha256": "c88ed07e467ce8c6acaf313babc7df4967a9e8c32584327d5d7c87ade56f6054", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 28, "source_bbox": [48, 1574, 1220, 1625], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-29", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-29.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-29.txt", "text": "szowane, choćby nawet dobrze zapłaciła? — Strach pomy-", "sha256": "b63d30005c629864c9f004363af188f06345944620ee990fc95b013543ab9c0c", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 29, "source_bbox": [48, 1627, 1220, 1682], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-30", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-30.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-30.txt", "text": "śleć, co za berbeluchy sprzedają dzisiaj pod nazwą wina!...", "sha256": "fdf48a4a8fa60fc981905c63a270e202a0e3b93c938fda59b37086d30d72c9a8", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 30, "source_bbox": [48, 1680, 1220, 1735], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-31", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-31.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-31.txt", "text": "Słuchajcie, co mówi znany lekarz (Dr. E. Danie-", "sha256": "e42d7aa6275124e5282fd5d94bb7e4bff3a584109edecea15dd0cd36b078bfd2", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 31, "source_bbox": [48, 1733, 1220, 1785], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "odezwa-12-32", "image": "pairs/odezwa-12-32.png", "text_file": "pairs/odezwa-12-32.txt", "text": "lewicz) o gatunkach wina, które rodzice najczęściej", "sha256": "f48126f14766a5695470eb18fb1a053fae7eed5a7fe1b5dfbd0af9469076dd89", "source_page": "odezwa-12", "source_sha256": "4d6cbe430ba8c89a52c426fc9109912fc3318d2bfa139bbfa623c9f04d815f6b", "reference_line_index": 32, "source_bbox": [48, 1788, 1220, 1843], "crop_method": "manual horizontal projection; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-00", "image": "pairs/torun-74-00.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-00.txt", "text": "— 74 —", "sha256": "ce873ded7e8094efd1f1a233ef6efa0a42790c398e0ad1676fe8953ac9e190e7", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 0, "source_bbox": [850, 215, 1210, 275], "crop_method": "manual page-number box"}
{"id": "torun-74-01", "image": "pairs/torun-74-01.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-01.txt", "text": "Zabawa w ptaszka.", "sha256": "d6b1327b970c9246e0efc9a009e4d336a87cf8d2b631e50b557c1887646f04fd", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 1, "source_bbox": [650, 310, 1340, 410], "crop_method": "manual heading box"}
{"id": "torun-74-02", "image": "pairs/torun-74-02.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-02.txt", "text": "Wszystkie dzieci, których powinno być nie do pary, t. j.", "sha256": "b5d3253aa84691fcb1b3fbd29cebcdd98213aef7edbaf4410af20087552aa31d", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 2, "source_bbox": [312, 407, 1669, 459], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-03", "image": "pairs/torun-74-03.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-03.txt", "text": "5, 7, 9, 11, 13 itd. stają kołem. Najstarsze oblicza, poczy-", "sha256": "ebf68b85031b6e0554ecc70f65fe108b562214f7a9c521355b8f712a607339a6", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 3, "source_bbox": [312, 453, 1669, 504], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-04", "image": "pairs/torun-74-04.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-04.txt", "text": "nając od siebie, tak: Za — wie — le — tu — dzie — ci — mam", "sha256": "0c3b8b7d50498435a376b5b7f6b4e51b4b79b766006eaa79f1205b407cbbee98", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 4, "source_bbox": [312, 498, 1669, 550], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-05", "image": "pairs/torun-74-05.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-05.txt", "text": "— Więc — ty — so — bie — u — stąp — tam. Na każde dziecko", "sha256": "4462d870421fb2fbfe9fd3ead2e0d7f8b619c796405726d64c23daea34223f3e", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 5, "source_bbox": [312, 544, 1669, 595], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-06", "image": "pairs/torun-74-06.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-06.txt", "text": "przypada jedna sylaba. To, na które padła sylaba »tam«, —", "sha256": "f9fca83873b4080bc9db8820be45c879dd469929f3703aeab9790030263a40ba", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 6, "source_bbox": [312, 589, 1669, 641], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-07", "image": "pairs/torun-74-07.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-07.txt", "text": "ustępuje. To, które pozostanie, będzie ptaszkiem i idzie w", "sha256": "806aeed57e3f51f201f0baa0953d678b42215ba0e6f3c0d5eb05f40a39d33f86", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 7, "source_bbox": [312, 635, 1669, 686], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-08", "image": "pairs/torun-74-08.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-08.txt", "text": "koło. Chodząc koło ptaszka śpiewają dzieci:", "sha256": "bc4caf6dc3f421b3d1ae2126475d7af5cbcf3d79506ef26e2828fc3672593f8f", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 8, "source_bbox": [312, 680, 1669, 732], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-09", "image": "pairs/torun-74-09.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-09.txt", "text": "Siedzi gołąb na ulicy — I wybiera groch z pszenicy,", "sha256": "a01a4221a41800ae65858c5d767811f04d3e0e62f8dbcdc9019f9a74a817a946", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 9, "source_bbox": [418, 731, 1504, 779], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-10", "image": "pairs/torun-74-10.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-10.txt", "text": "A ja sobie stoję w kole — I wybieram, kogo wolę.", "sha256": "9233042724b00e46f2999c3d6d8d4319089c1adb86864f319689339b4f413e72", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 10, "source_bbox": [418, 773, 1504, 822], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-11", "image": "pairs/torun-74-11.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-11.txt", "text": "Po prześpiewaniu tej zwrotki chwyta ptaszek jedno z", "sha256": "9065175bf196a87903a3df8962d7de1b66f1ec8e23cb408a9179bca5b8825fe4", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 11, "source_bbox": [308, 820, 1667, 871], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-12", "image": "pairs/torun-74-12.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-12.txt", "text": "dzieci za ręce, a wtonczas każdy szuka sobie pary. Kto pary", "sha256": "b271d44b4f0c18cdc04dfd79adf1f679dcb8c4cc8e06f9ad72b1ea65b4571268", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 12, "source_bbox": [308, 865, 1667, 916], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-13", "image": "pairs/torun-74-13.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-13.txt", "text": "nie znajdzie, idzie w koło, jako ptaszek i znów śpiew nastę-", "sha256": "f7339253aca27363f650dde18db27e5a98fbab5bbce486fb9b0e67515f3221df", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 13, "source_bbox": [308, 910, 1667, 961], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-14", "image": "pairs/torun-74-14.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-14.txt", "text": "puje. — Jeżeli jest dzieci do pary, w takim razie to, które", "sha256": "040c56950a933dafe66f147579775972ca192d7cdeb4a9e20ad317fdac0eca27", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 14, "source_bbox": [308, 955, 1667, 1006], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-15", "image": "pairs/torun-74-15.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-15.txt", "text": "przy odliczaniu ustąpiło pierwsze, będzie, jako ptasznik,", "sha256": "1a32cc4d54e49e9c1db2675e6a6567d17ad6d0372253de784cfcc83c6302cb64", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 15, "source_bbox": [308, 1000, 1667, 1051], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-16", "image": "pairs/torun-74-16.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-16.txt", "text": "stojąc poza kołem, uważało, żeby jastrząb nie porwał ptaszka.", "sha256": "3722e304437bd7346fbb28ff41aa9563bc230550495ac24a4baade752bdf168d", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 16, "source_bbox": [308, 1045, 1667, 1095], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-17", "image": "pairs/torun-74-17.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-17.txt", "text": "Gdy już jest nowy ptaszek, chwyta ptasznik jedno z dzieci", "sha256": "80479490b26b47431832c5d17905ea32fe4605ed523ae23eaa17066fc97209cb", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 17, "source_bbox": [308, 1089, 1667, 1140], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-18", "image": "pairs/torun-74-18.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-18.txt", "text": "za rękę i znów każdy, z wyjątkiem ptaszka, szuka sobie", "sha256": "286c07a74adc270057643011d6c28d9b294d1dc6c8a91777e35adb038cb57b57", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 18, "source_bbox": [308, 1134, 1667, 1185], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-19", "image": "pairs/torun-74-19.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-19.txt", "text": "pary. Kto pary nie znajdzie, będzie ptasznikiem. Gdy już", "sha256": "90fbf86c10f34a7bfd3623693d29dbbb68a5009c5db3dafe88e76c5f6fa50a1c", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 19, "source_bbox": [308, 1179, 1667, 1230], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-20", "image": "pairs/torun-74-20.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-20.txt", "text": "jest nowy ptaszek i nowy ptasznik, tworzy znowu reszta", "sha256": "188bc07a49cab89f4fa07a6bdfc92310b678bb62b00cecdacccd6d0e5f01e309", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 20, "source_bbox": [308, 1224, 1667, 1275], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-21", "image": "pairs/torun-74-21.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-21.txt", "text": "dzieci kółko i zaczynają znów śpiewać.", "sha256": "187934b2c0f7c03aa807ea6d4bbef5d4fa45d51456564e3797e99b5efcdf362a", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 21, "source_bbox": [308, 1269, 1667, 1320], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-22", "image": "pairs/torun-74-22.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-22.txt", "text": "Zabawa w rzemiosła.", "sha256": "8879c6f07e0c34aa31f308240ee16bff4be045566bb561b5589111aa65dbe5f0", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 22, "source_bbox": [610, 1385, 1370, 1472], "crop_method": "manual heading box"}
{"id": "torun-74-23", "image": "pairs/torun-74-23.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-23.txt", "text": "Dzieci biorą się za ręce i tworzą koło, w którem staje,", "sha256": "381ebcdf30d822fbbc9dd023f855312ece97f6504072ba51c887f67e9c6463f2", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 23, "source_bbox": [305, 1484, 1663, 1540], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-24", "image": "pairs/torun-74-24.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-24.txt", "text": "jako przewodnik, najśmielsze z nich, i zaczynają śpiewać:", "sha256": "29cc12dd0d75641d50c5dcd51fabf0f8133505e62318fd9d013ed06b2571a5c0", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 24, "source_bbox": [305, 1534, 1663, 1590], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-25", "image": "pairs/torun-74-25.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-25.txt", "text": "Ojciec pracować uczy dzieci swoje —", "sha256": "7eeb96284c87341feb46a9991d370fd90f1aa23290eebf848c2790dd3f6008a6", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 25, "source_bbox": [607, 1589, 1431, 1633], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-26", "image": "pairs/torun-74-26.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-26.txt", "text": "A miał ich tylko sto dwadzieścia troje —", "sha256": "752be7f26d0d7a82a4066314de2fb89d653207dcbffa6624d69575f6e45fc49a", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 26, "source_bbox": [607, 1627, 1431, 1671], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-27", "image": "pairs/torun-74-27.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-27.txt", "text": "Hejże, dzieci, hejże ha —", "sha256": "3daafa2de0421036d5d82dab5b19c0b0c85deeb7d29fc9545a8cd5c0b2fade82", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 27, "source_bbox": [607, 1665, 1431, 1709], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-28", "image": "pairs/torun-74-28.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-28.txt", "text": "Róbcie wszystko to co ja!", "sha256": "4a357dbd305e5a170e0422053846289d6452fa5c17512067eeb9c94104940db2", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 28, "source_bbox": [607, 1703, 1431, 1747], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-29", "image": "pairs/torun-74-29.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-29.txt", "text": "Przewodnik przy słowach »Róbcie wszystkie to, co ja!«", "sha256": "1e1d8f546ff52ec1af66e600ab5670500c77dd129c0ae1f960f705981210c768", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 29, "source_bbox": [280, 1748, 1666, 1799], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-30", "image": "pairs/torun-74-30.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-30.txt", "text": "udaje różne czynności n. p. pisanie, szycie, młócenie, kosze-", "sha256": "4fee66f023e34dc56618ada4d374c1c0d8f1ced09d65dd2938af4e1ca16b4a74", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 30, "source_bbox": [280, 1793, 1666, 1844], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-31", "image": "pairs/torun-74-31.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-31.txt", "text": "nie, kucie, strzelanie itd., a każdy powinien robić to, co", "sha256": "24b483ede80a0620223b66bba2968aad33dd17427cfe7ba58d25e0d778ee6162", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 31, "source_bbox": [280, 1838, 1666, 1890], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-32", "image": "pairs/torun-74-32.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-32.txt", "text": "przewodnik. Kto się pomyli, daje fant. Tak powtarza się do", "sha256": "5fcf6c00cdb72421011a5960c61311a5159b6f4d29217f0815fd4e68ffcd583b", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 32, "source_bbox": [280, 1884, 1666, 1935], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-33", "image": "pairs/torun-74-33.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-33.txt", "text": "woli, a potem wykupuje się fanty. To z dzieci, które było", "sha256": "ef80fb5f14ab04536e224d037830022275cc15921cf12ae81db29b84b12a4925", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 33, "source_bbox": [280, 1929, 1666, 1980], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-34", "image": "pairs/torun-74-34.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-34.txt", "text": "w kole, bierze wszystkie fanty w czapkę, fartuch, koszyk", "sha256": "0f27afb0502559002984e5063bab966bb04b40847bec7ccfba167adb57c354bd", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 34, "source_bbox": [280, 1974, 1666, 2025], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-35", "image": "pairs/torun-74-35.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-35.txt", "text": "lub chustkę, a wybrawszy jeden, ale nie pokazując go nikomu,", "sha256": "6d59be7f337192e9e50f471c980f6a531e3db19df036aa48063803aad9710980", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 35, "source_bbox": [280, 2019, 1666, 2071], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-36", "image": "pairs/torun-74-36.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-36.txt", "text": "pyta: »Jakiej podać ma się męce ten, którego fant w mej", "sha256": "2a797c988809d79e1a9ad40d8b240962409cf259203ad9a1902a12e210911cfe", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 36, "source_bbox": [280, 2065, 1666, 2116], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-37", "image": "pairs/torun-74-37.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-37.txt", "text": "ręce?« Dzieci po kolei sądzą, co właściciel fantu ma zrobić.", "sha256": "812f70d41703af34880dc59544f1f08741d57c8e3664449f9e77bf7a6aa8f7a8", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 37, "source_bbox": [280, 2110, 1666, 2161], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
{"id": "torun-74-38", "image": "pairs/torun-74-38.png", "text_file": "pairs/torun-74-38.txt", "text": "Można mówić: Niech zaśpiewa po polsku, niech powie polski", "sha256": "8e5a8f659c34087bb5863ac06f0668af1889a571323bd0b85bc305c64eff4673", "source_page": "torun-74", "source_sha256": "9a9cc00e24a28fcf7ae3c6f43898500753fcbd2da8e1951c5880579bd9dfe206", "reference_line_index": 38, "source_bbox": [280, 2155, 1666, 2206], "crop_method": "equal subdivision of detected paragraph; visually verified"}
